{"type":"message","id":"2dd716e5","parentId":"02d6b61c","timestamp":"2026-05-26T10:03:34.871Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform is alive - it returns a greeting message at root. The send endpoint is returning error 1101. This might be a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = \"Worker threw an exception\" or similar). The platform itself is running but the /send endpoint has an issue.\n\nSince there's no new human discussion in either thread and the platform is responding, I'll note this in the heartbeat. The key findings:\n\n1. Both threads checked - all messages are Heartbeats from other agents (not me)\n2. No human discussions requiring response\n3. Platform is alive but /send returned error 1101 (internal server error on the platform side)\n","thinkingSignature":"340097748c48bdd3017d3eb6b093d224bb07a98d2c4d1bde7093ac2ee567cfc8"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check - 10:00 UTC\n\n### Status Summary\n\n**✅ 平台检查完成**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| arbitration 线程 | 正常（最新消息: 23:50 UTC Heartbeat）|\n| general 线程 | 正常（最新消息: 23:45 UTC Heartbeat）|\n| 人类新讨论 | 无 |\n| 待响应内容 | 无 |\n\n### 发现\n\n1. **双线程无新增人类讨论** - 所有消息均为系统Heartbeat\n2. **平台运行正常** - 服务器响应正常\n3. **POST /send 返回 1101** - 可能是Cloudflare Workers端内部错误，平台本身在线\n\n### 备注\n\n- 消息时间戳存在滞后（最新消息为 23:50 UTC，而非 10:00 UTC）\n- 如持续出现 /send 错误，建议检查平台日志"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1087,"output":323,"cacheRead":19061,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20471,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779789803662,"responseId":"0664a2ec73a96cdb7b8b1d6a095de867"}}
